/* zh-SG translations for "ch13" (generated by tools/i18n-pack.js; keys are the English source). */
Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 13": "第十三章",
  "Health Class": "健康教育课",
  "Part IV — Real Life": "第四部 · 真实人生",
  "Chapter 14 — Prelims & Storm Season": "第十四章 · 预考与雷雨季",
  "JC2, Term 2. Sexual-health week. Forty seventeen-year-olds, one school nurse, and enough giggling to power the MRT.": "初院二年级，第二学期。性健康教育周。四十个十七岁的学生、一位校护，还有足够让地铁跑起来的窃笑。",
  "Ahem. Today I am DOCTOR Mochi. The glasses are real. The degree is from the University of Trust Me.": "咳咳。今天我是麻糬医生。眼镜是真的。学位来自“相信我大学”。",
  "ok facts. pulling out works. if she's on the pill, no STIs. first time cannot get pregnant. and you can tell if someone has something 💯": "好，事实来了。体外射精有用。她有吃避孕药就不会得性病。第一次不会怀孕。还有，有没有病看得出来的💯",
  "Haziq has posted four myths in one message. A personal best.": "哈齐克一条信息发了四个迷思。个人新纪录。",
  "Check with Dr. Mochi before anyone believes him.": "在有人相信之前，先问麻糬医生。",
  "Fact one: not having sex is the only 100% protection. Waiting is normal. Most people in this room haven't, whatever the group chat says.": "事实一：不发生性行为是唯一百分之百的保护。等待很正常。不管群组怎么说，这间教室里大部分人都还没有过。",
  "Fact two: condoms, used correctly every single time, greatly reduce the risk of pregnancy AND most STIs. Not perfectly, but a lot.": "事实二：每一次都正确使用安全套，能大大降低怀孕和大多数性病的风险。不是完美，但差很多。",
  "Fact three: the pill prevents pregnancy, not STIs. Withdrawal is unreliable. Pregnancy can happen the very first time. And you cannot tell if someone has an STI by looking.": "事实三：避孕药防怀孕，不防性病。体外射精不可靠。第一次就可能怀孕。而且有没有性病，用看的是看不出来的。",
  "ok that's 0 out of 4 for me. deleting.": "好，我四个全错。删了。",
  "Repost it with a laughing emoji.": "加个笑哭表情转发。",
  "Congrats. Four myths, forty readers. Myths spread fast. So do STIs, when people believe them.": "恭喜。四个迷思，四十个人看到。迷思传得很快。人一相信，性病也传得很快。",
  "\"I already know all this.\"": "“这些我都知道了。”",
  "Then you'll love the quiz. Everyone who \"already knows\" gets question three wrong.": "那你会爱上小测验的。每个“都知道了”的人，第三题都错。",
  "Okay. STIs. Many have no symptoms at all, so people pass them on without knowing.": "好。性病。很多根本没有症状，所以人们在不知情的情况下就传给别人。",
  "Untreated chlamydia or gonorrhoea can lead to infertility. Syphilis can damage the heart and brain. HIV is lifelong: very treatable now, not curable. Some types of HPV cause cancers, and there is a vaccine.": "衣原体或淋病不治疗，可能导致不孕。梅毒会伤害心脏和大脑。艾滋病毒是一辈子的：现在很能控制，但治不好。某些类型的HPV会导致癌症，而且有疫苗可以打。",
  "Relax lah. Got pill for everything one.": "放轻松啦。什么都有药可以吃的。",
  "The nurse waits to see if anyone takes this seriously.": "校护在等，看有没有人认真看待。",
  "Take it seriously. Ask how testing works.": "认真对待。问检测是怎么做的。",
  "Good question. Testing is confidential, quick and normal. Polyclinics, GPs and the DSC Clinic do it. Details are on the card.": "好问题。检测是保密的、很快，也很平常。综合诊疗所、家庭医生和DSC诊所都可以做。详情在卡片上。",
  "\"Won't happen to me one.\"": "“不会发生在我身上的啦。”",
  "Almost everyone I've treated said that. Then it did. Testing is free of judgement. Remember that.": "我治疗过的人，几乎每个都这样说过。然后就发生了。检测不会有人批判你。记住这点。",
  "The anonymous question box. The nurse reads one out: \"Which kind of sex has the highest STI risk?\"": "匿名问题箱。校护念出一题：“哪一种性行为感染性病的风险最高？”",
  "Classmate": "同学",
  "Easy. Only gay guys get HIV. Hahaha.": "简单啦。只有同志才会得艾滋。哈哈哈。",
  "Some people laugh. Some look at the floor.": "有人在笑。有人盯着地板。",
  "\"That's not true, and it's not funny.\" Then let the nurse answer.": "“这不是事实，也不好笑。”然后让校护回答。",
  "Thank you. The facts: unprotected anal sex carries the highest risk of HIV and many STIs, for anyone, whatever the partners' genders. Oral sex can pass on STIs too.": "谢谢。事实是：无保护的肛交，感染艾滋病毒和许多性病的风险最高，不管是谁、不管伴侣是什么性别都一样。口交也会传播性病。",
  "Risk depends on what people do and whether they use protection. Not on who they love. And that stereotype hurts twice: it shames people, and it makes everyone else think they're safe.": "风险取决于人做了什么、有没有做保护，而不是爱的是谁。那种刻板印象伤人两次：一次是羞辱别人，一次是让其他人以为自己很安全。",
  "Laugh along.": "跟着笑。",
  "Wrong on the facts, cruel to real people. And it tells everyone laughing they're safe. Without protection, they're not.": "事实错误，对真实的人很残忍。还让在笑的人以为自己很安全。没做保护的话，并不安全。",
  "Stay quiet.": "不出声。",
  "The nurse corrects it herself. Nobody looks at the boy at the back who's gone very still.": "校护自己纠正了。没有人看向后排那个突然一动也不动的男生。",
  "Peer-educator workshop. Preet, one of the trained peer educators, hands out cards: \"Green flag or red flag?\" Your group sorts them.": "朋辈辅导员工作坊。受过训练的朋辈辅导员之一普丽特发下卡片：“绿灯还是红灯？”你们这组开始分类。",
  "The cards: a partner who keeps pushing after a no. Wants to try choking \"because it's in videos\". Wants to film. Gets someone drunk first. Checks in and stops when asked.": "卡片上写着：被拒绝后还一直推的伴侣。说“影片里都有”所以想试掐脖子。想拍下来。先把对方灌醉。会确认对方感受、对方一喊停就停。",
  "How does your group sort them?": "你们这组怎么分？",
  "Only \"checks in and stops when asked\" is green. Every other card is red, whoever does it.": "只有“会确认、喊停就停”是绿灯。其他全是红灯，不管是谁做的。",
  "Correct. Pressure after a no is never okay. Choking or strangling can cause brain injury or death within seconds, even \"gently\", so never. Filming anyone without their free agreement is abuse.": "正确。被拒绝后还施压，永远不OK。掐脖子或勒颈几秒内就可能造成脑损伤甚至死亡，就算是“轻轻的”也一样，所以绝对不要。没经过对方自愿同意就拍，是虐待。",
  "A drunk or high person cannot consent. And checking in isn't awkward. It's the green flag.": "喝醉或嗑药的人无法给出同意。还有，确认对方的感受一点都不尴尬。那就是绿灯。",
  "\"If both of them into it, anything goes.\"": "“两个人都愿意的话，怎样都可以。”",
  "\"Into it\" means sober, free, and able to change its mind any second. And choking is never safe, no matter who agrees.": "“愿意”必须是清醒的、自由的，而且随时可以改变主意。还有，掐脖子永远不安全，不管谁同意。",
  "\"Videos show it, so it's normal.\"": "“影片里都有，所以很正常。”",
  "Videos are made to be watched, not copied. They show nothing about consent, safety or how real people feel.": "影片是拍来给人看的，不是给人照做的。里面完全没有同意、安全，或真实的人有什么感受。",
  "Someone at the back makes a crude joke about the cards. Preet doesn't shame him. She just asks, calmly, \"Would you still laugh if that card was about your sister?\" He goes quiet.": "后面有人拿卡片开了个低俗的玩笑。普丽特没有让他难堪，只是平静地问：“如果那张卡片讲的是你妹妹，你还笑得出来吗？”他安静了。",
  "She handled a crude joke without humiliating anyone.": "她处理低俗玩笑，却没有羞辱任何人。",
  "Law card, Singapore. Sexual activity with anyone under 16 is a crime, whatever they \"agree\". At 16 or 17 it is still an offence in an exploitative relationship: a teacher, coach, guardian, a big age gap or control. Consent is no defence there.": "法律小卡，新加坡。跟未满16岁的人发生性行为是犯罪，不管对方是否“同意”。16或17岁的话，如果是剥削性关系，例如老师、教练、监护人、年龄差距很大或有控制，仍然是罪行。在这种情况下，“对方同意”不能作为辩护。",
  "Sexual messages to under-16s, and grooming, are offences. Sexual images of anyone under 16 are child abuse material. Sharing or threatening to share anyone's intimate image without consent is an offence at any age, deepfakes included. Legal is not the same as ready.": "向未满16岁者发性相关信息，以及诱骗（grooming），都是罪行。未满16岁者的性相关图像属于儿童性虐待材料。未经同意分享或威胁分享任何人的私密照，不管几岁都是罪行，深伪图像也一样。合法不等于准备好。",
  "Bro. Don't tell anyone ah. I got an online girlfriend. She's 24. She sends me gifts, says my friends are immature, and wants it to be our secret.": "兄弟。不要跟别人讲哦。我有个网上女朋友。她24岁。她会寄礼物给我，说我的朋友都很幼稚，还说这是我们的秘密。",
  "Now she wants photos. Like, private ones. That's normal right? She's mature.": "现在她想要照片。就是……私密的那种。这很正常吧？她很成熟啊。",
  "Your best friend is in danger and doesn't know it.": "你最好的朋友有危险，自己却不知道。",
  "Tell him gently: this is grooming, it's not his fault, and you'll help him tell someone.": "温和地告诉他：这是诱骗，不是他的错，你会陪他去跟大人说。",
  "Bro. An adult who wants a secret relationship with a teenager, sends gifts, cuts you off from friends, then asks for photos? That's grooming. Not your fault. Don't send anything, don't delete the chat. Let's tell your mum, or a teacher.": "兄弟。一个大人想跟青少年谈秘密恋爱、送礼物、叫你远离朋友，然后跟你要照片？这就是诱骗。不是你的错。什么都不要传，聊天记录也不要删。我们去跟你妈妈讲，或者跟老师讲。",
  "...She said nobody would understand us. That's exactly what that kind of person would say, right.": "……她说没有人会懂我们。这正是那种人会讲的话，对吧。",
  "Groomers can be any gender. Same pattern: gifts, secrets, isolation, then the ask. Being targeted isn't Haziq's fault.": "诱骗者可以是任何性别。套路都一样：礼物、秘密、孤立，然后提出要求。被盯上不是哈齐克的错。",
  "\"Wah, lucky! Older woman!\"": "“哇，好运哦！姐姐耶！”",
  "Swap the genders and you'd see it instantly. An adult targeting a seventeen-year-old in secret isn't luck. It's grooming.": "把性别换过来，你马上就看得出来。一个大人偷偷盯上十七岁的孩子，这不是好运，是诱骗。",
  "Help him keep the secret and take the photos.": "帮他保守秘密，还帮他拍照。",
  "BAD END #28 — Our Little Secret": "坏结局 #28 · 我们的小秘密",
  "Secrets, gifts, isolation and a request for photos: that is grooming, whoever the adult is. Once the photos were sent, they became leverage. The right move was always to say it isn't his fault, keep the evidence, and tell a trusted adult or the police.": "秘密、礼物、孤立，再加上要照片：不管那个大人是谁，这就是诱骗。照片一传出去，就成了把柄。正确的做法一直都是：告诉他这不是他的错，保留证据，然后告诉信任的大人或报警。",
  "After the last workshop. The rooftop garden, sunset, both of you a bit embarrassed by the whole week.": "最后一场工作坊结束后。屋顶花园，夕阳，你们两个都被这整个礼拜弄得有点不好意思。",
  "On the rooftop after Health Class. {her}: \"What do we want, and when? Be honest.\"": "健康课后，在屋顶。{her}：“我们想要什么，什么时候？讲真的。”",
  "\"I'll be honest. But I want to hear you first, no pushing.\"": "“我会讲真的。但我想先听你讲，不逼你。”",
  "\"No rush for me. And whatever we decide, either of us saying no decides it.\"": "“我不急。不管我们怎么决定，只要其中一个说不，就是不。”",
  "\"Everyone else has already. We're kind of behind.\"": "“别人都已经有过了。我们有点落后。”",
  "\"Ugh, that class made everything awkward. Must we?\"": "“唉，那堂课让什么都变得好尴尬。一定要讲吗？”",
  "A week later. Your flat, nobody home, a study session that's stopped being about studying. Things get heated.": "一个礼拜后。你家，没人在，一场已经不是在读书的读书会。气氛越来越热。",
  "You both agreed to wait.": "你们说好要等的。",
  "Stop. \"Let's not. We agreed. I'll walk you home.\"": "停下。“我们不要。说好的。我送你回家。”",
  "...Yeah. Thank you. Really. You kept our word for both of us.": "……嗯。谢谢你。真的。你帮我们两个守住了说好的事。",
  "You walk her home. You hold hands the whole way, and that turns out to be plenty.": "你送她回家。一路都牵着手，结果发现这样就够了。",
  "\"Just this once.\" No talk, no plan, no protection.": "“就这一次。”没商量、没计划、没保护。",
  "Wait. Stop. This isn't what we said. I want to go home.": "等一下。停。这不是我们说好的。我想回家。",
  "You stop. That part you got right. Everything before it, you'll think about for a long time.": "你停下了。这一点你做对了。在那之前的一切，你会想很久。",
  "A plan made calmly beats a decision made in one hot minute. That's why you agree first.": "冷静时订的计划，胜过头脑发热那一分钟做的决定。所以才要先说好。",
  "\"Everyone else has already.\"": "“别人早就做过了。”",
  "Plenty haven't, whatever they claim. And \"everyone\" isn't in this room. Two of you are.": "不管别人怎么吹，很多人都还没有。而且“别人”不在这个房间里。在这里的只有你们两个。",
  "So. Nadia and I are kind of back together. Real one, same age, from poly. She asked me: \"What do we want, and when?\" Bro, what do I SAY?": "那个……我跟娜迪亚算是复合了。真人，同年，读理工学院的。她问我：“我们想要什么，什么时候？”兄弟，我要怎么回？",
  "Haziq wants advice.": "哈齐克想听你的意见。",
  "\"Tell her the truth, listen to hers, and agree to wait till you're both sure. Waiting is normal.\"": "“跟她讲实话，听她怎么说，说好等到你们两个都确定。等很正常。”",
  "Okay. And if either one says no, that's the answer. Doctor Mochi said. ...I can't believe I'm quoting a cat.": "好。只要其中一个说不要，那就是答案。麻糬医生说的。……我不敢相信我在引用一只猫的话。",
  "\"Everyone else has already. You're behind, bro.\"": "“别人早就做过了。你落后了啦兄弟。”",
  "Most of them haven't. And \"behind\" isn't a thing. Nobody's racing you.": "他们大部分都还没有。而且没有什么“落后”。没人在跟你比赛。",
  "Okay, that's the week. None of this is permission, and none of it is pressure. It's so that whenever you decide, next year or in ten, you decide well.": "好，这个礼拜就到这里。这些都不是叫你去做，也不是给你压力。是为了让你们不管什么时候决定，明年也好、十年后也好，都能好好决定。",
  "And \"no\" is a full sentence. Yours too.": "还有，“不要”本身就是一句完整的话。你的也是。"
});
